    "Normal mode": {},
    "Normal mode (WiFi or USB): how often the position is read while idle, and the shortest Step tracking interval. Sub-second commands have caused trouble on the HAZ46 in Normal mode.": {},
    "Normal mode over the mount's USB port: Passive and Step tracking, as over WiFi. If the mount is in Special mode it leaves it, and its position is carried across.": {},
    "Normal mode over the mount's WiFi: Passive and Step tracking. Join the mount's WiFi network first. 10.10.100.254:8899 is iOptron's usual address; check your manual.": {},
    "Normal mode updates": {},
