    "Or enter where it points": {},
    "Orbital elements and the satellite catalogue (launch, orbit, radar cross-section) come from CelesTrak. Physical dimensions come from Jonathan McDowell's General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects (planet4589.org/space/gcat), under CC BY 4.0. Radio transmitters come from the SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org), under CC BY-SA 4.0. Deep sky objects come from OpenNGC by Mattia Verga, under CC BY-SA 4.0, star names from the IAU Working Group on Star Names, and comet orbits from the IAU Minor Planet Center.": {
      "comment": "Keep the names of people, organisations, catalogues, websites and licences as they are: CelesTrak, General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects, SatNOGS DB, OpenNGC, IAU, CC BY 4.0, CC BY-SA 4.0."
    },
